{
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "items": [
        "Sketch is a fixed d \u00d7 w grid: increment d cells per item, estimate is the minimum \u2014 it never undercounts, error is bounded",
        "The sketch only estimates counts; the min-heap of size K remembers the candidates for top-K"
      ],
      "title": "Count-min sketch + heap"
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "items": [
        "Partition by item id so all events for an item reach one worker; merging local top-Ks gives the correct global top-K",
        "Tumbling 1-minute buckets are merged for longer windows; results can be seconds to a minute stale"
      ],
      "title": "Fast path"
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "items": [
        "Raw events in S3 / data lake; hourly batch computes exact counts for reporting or payouts \u2014 Lambda architecture",
        "Trending is a spike over baseline (ratio with smoothing and a minimum volume), not raw popularity"
      ],
      "title": "Slow path & trending"
    }
  ],
